/E ( I had the opportunity to volunteer with AUSF, where I participated in numerous activities and workshops that contributed significantly to my personal development. During my involvement, I learned how to effectively manage time and cope with stress by attending time management and stress management sessions. I also deepened my knowledge of human rights and learned how to communicate effectively in both professional and interpersonal contexts. The team building activities allowed me to work in a team and collaborate with other volunteers, strengthening my relationships and creating lasting friendships. My experience at AUSF has provided me with a balance between personal development and fun, being an environment where I have been able to develop my social and professional skills while enjoying enjoyable and constructive activities.)
